<title>CANADA: Mohawk refinances with C$45 mln credit line.</title>
<headline>Mohawk refinances with C$45 mln credit line.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mohawk Canada Ltd said on Thursday it entered an agreement to refinance most of its bank debt and planned capital expenditures with a C$45 million credit facility.</p>
<p>Royal Bank of Canada is lead bank on the deal, joined by HSBC Holdings Plc's Hongkong Bank of Canada and ABN AMRO Holding's ABN AMRO Bank Canada.</p>
<p>Mohawk markets alternative fuels and lubricants.</p>
<p>((-- Reuters Vancouver Bureau (604) 664-7314))</p>
